## What We Are Building

Not a code task — an **operational harness cleanup**. Director flagged (2026-05-27) that session context fills too fast. Root cause diagnosed: the global ECC install at `~/.claude/` injects 149 skill descriptions + 48 agent descriptions + 82 command descriptions into the system reminder EVERY turn. (MCP tool schemas are already deferred by the harness, so they are NOT the bloat.)

Goal: run `agent-sort` (evidence-based DAILY vs LIBRARY classification against the real SandyStudio stack) + `harness-audit` (MCP servers + session discipline), then trim the autoloaded surface to what SandyStudio actually uses, keeping everything restorable.

SandyStudio stack (the only project this global install serves): Next.js 15 / TypeScript / React 19 / Tailwind / Three.js + Supabase (Postgres) + Inngest + OpenAI/Anthropic SDK + Zod + vitest + markdown agent specs + AI media (fal.ai/Seedance/gpt-image/Veo). NO Python/Go/Rust/Java/Kotlin/Swift/PHP/Flutter/C++/Django/Laravel/Spring.

---

## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **agent-sort classification** — confirmed by: 3 parallel subagents returned DAILY/LIBRARY tables with repo evidence. Counts: skills ~45 DAILY / ~100 LIBRARY; agents 25/23; commands 34/45; rules 21/55.
- **Trim execution (PowerShell move)** — confirmed by: script reported `skills-library: 75 moved, 0 missing`, `agents-library: 19 moved, 0 missing`, `commands-library: 18 moved, 0 missing`. Remaining counts verified: skills 149→**74**, agents 48→**29**, commands 82→**64**.
- **Effect is already live** — confirmed by: the in-session skill list re-scanned and off-stack skills (python/go/rust/kotlin/swift/laravel/django/springboot/etc.) disappeared from the available-skills reminder. No restart needed.
- **SandyStudio DAILY skills intact** — confirmed by: animator, storyboarder-*, seedance-prompting, sandystudio-archivist, episode-serialization, eref-*, library-style-first, sandy-gag-library still present in the refreshed list. None were in the move arrays.
- **MCP/hook audit** — confirmed by: subagent read `mcp-needs-auth-cache.json` + configs. Finding: connectors (Gmail/Figma/Vercel/Gamma/Calendar/Drive/Canva) are account-global plugin connectors, `mcpServers` is `{}` in `.claude.json`. 8 SandyStudio governance hooks all healthy, backing scripts exist.
- **Memory written** — `harness_trim_skills_library.md` + MEMORY.md index line.

